AgOpenWeb-HAT is under three licences. Each file says which in its first lines
(SPDX-License-Identifier); the full texts are in LICENSES/.

  MIT (LICENSES/MIT.txt)
      What was written for this project: most of the daemon (core/, daemon/,
      hal/, boards/, web/server.*), the tests, deploy/, docs/, CI and the
      hardware tools (hardware/tools/).

  GPL-3.0-or-later (LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt)
      What is ported or copied from the AgOpenGPS Teensy AiO firmware
      (Firmware_Teensy_AiO-New-Dawn, copyright 2025 by the AOG Group, GPL v3):
      the tractor CAN files (core/*/can/), the autosteer, GNSS, IMU, GVRET,
      UM98x, logging, LED and settings code, the web pages and their API
      (web/pages/, web/api.*), daemon/main.cpp, deploy/aow-hatctl, and the CAN
      brand files (deploy/can-config/*.json, which carry no header).
      Also third_party/aog-taskcontroller/ (AOG-TaskController, GPL-3.0,
      unmodified).

  CERN-OHL-P-2.0 (LICENSES/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.txt)
      The hardware designs in hardware/ (except hardware/tools/): the design
      documents, netlists, BOMs, EasyEDA exports and Gerbers. Files that
      cannot carry a header (exports, CSV, Gerbers, PDF) are under it too.

aow-hatd as built links the GPL-3.0-or-later files, so the program as a whole
is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later. The MIT files may be reused on their
own under MIT. third_party/ArduinoJson/ is MIT (its own LICENSE.txt).

Copyright (c) 2026 The AgOpenWeb-HAT contributors, except where a file says
otherwise.
